 "remarks": "The Ultimate Belltown Retreat \"Welcome home to 103 Ledge Lane! This stunningly refreshed 5-bedroom residence offers a rare combination of space, privacy, and modern updates in one of Stamford's most desirable pockets. Featuring a separate-entry floor plan ideal for guests or Multigenerational living, plus a beautifully manicured yard that opens to nature. With updated appliances including washer and dryer , New HVAC system, Separate climate controls for upstairs and downstairs, Brand new third floor loft -ideal for home office or Gym. Great set up for joint or extended family living. This home is move-in ready and waiting for its next chapter. Don't miss this unique opportunity for spacious living in a quiet, central location",
